OL,3,GNEWSAGig-going artist draws 'crazy
OL,4,Acrowds' from mosh pit
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was all a bit of a joke and a laugh
OL,7,Funtil I realised, no one else is doing
OL,8,Fthis and it is actually really fun," he
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,F"Some of the favourite bands I've drawn
OL,12,Flive include Basht, who I am on tour
OL,13,Fwith now, but also Turnstile live at
OL,14,Fthe Piece Hall, Fontaines D.C. at Leeds
OL,15,FFestival and Kneecap, who were just
OL,16,Fcrazy."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
